	)
	(text "It is not recommended to add a lowpass filter to the CSA output, the datasheet rates the CSA slew rate at 10V/us for a 60pF load,\nif you add 1nF of capacitance it might slow down the CSA and you could get inaccurate current readings.\nInstead I suggest removing the low pass filter and setting your ADC sampling time to 2000ns (CSA settling time to 1% with 40V/V gain),\\\nduring this time the CSA will charge the internal ADC capacitor.\n\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at -142.494 15.748 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "985744ac-8051-4faf-9801-1e8c986e7e22")
	)
